WEBVTT

00:08:28.228 --> 00:08:31.085
coding for biological adaptations,

00:08:31.109 --> 00:08:33.109
coding for novelty.

00:08:34.243 --> 00:08:38.067
On Earth, it utterly
transformed the surface.

00:08:38.091 --> 00:08:41.495
Genes in the DNA
of single-celled organisms

00:08:41.519 --> 00:08:43.417
put oxygen in the air,

00:08:43.441 --> 00:08:45.299
extracted CO2,

00:08:45.323 --> 00:08:48.299
put chalk and iron ore into the ground,

00:08:48.323 --> 00:08:54.347
hardly a cubic inch of the surface
to some depth has remained unaffected

00:08:54.371 --> 00:08:56.299
by those genes.

00:08:56.942 --> 00:09:02.347
The Earth became,
if not a novel place on the cosmic scale,